  "submittedText": "ClashWise turns detected clashes into coordinated decisions your team can act on.\n\nThe boundary is important. Nav-is-works Clash Detective finds the clashes. ClashWise does not run clash detection. Instead, it adds the management layer around those results: clearer names, consistent priorities, responsibility, review, meeting records, reporting, and a route back into Nav-is-works.\n\nSo you keep the detection workflow you already trust. ClashWise helps with what happens next: deciding which clashes matter, who owns them, what the team agreed, and whether that decision made it back into the coordination model.",
